OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FIn 1987, a glowing radioactive
OL,7,     Fsubstance spread through the
OL,8,     FBrazilian city of Goiania. Odesson
OL,9,     FFerreira lived through the
OL,10,     Femergency and became an advocate
OL,11,     Ffor survivors.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FCameras started rolling on the
OL,14,     Ffilm City of God in 2001. It
OL,15,     Fcaptured the brutal realities of
OL,16,     Fchild gangsters in Rio De
OL,17,     FJaneiro's favelas.
